# Engineering Decision Records

This directory contains architectural and design decisions made during
the development of Boundflow.

The purpose of these records is not to document every implementation
detail, but to preserve important engineering choices:

- what problem required a decision;
- what alternatives were considered;
- why one option was selected;
- what consequences were accepted.

A design decision should answer:

> Why was this design chosen instead of other reasonable alternatives?

The resulting system behaviour is documented in:

- `docs/design.md`

The implementation and tests provide executable evidence of these decisions.

